# {{ sec_num }}. Capillary Pressure, Saturation Height Modeling (SHF) & SCAL

### {{ sec_num }}.1 Leverett $J$-Function, Lab-to-Reservoir $P_c$ Scaling & Core Stress Lineage

To initialize continuous 3D water saturation in the static geological cellular model above the Free Water Level ($FWL = {{ "%.1f"|format(sw_params.fwl) }}\text{ m TVDss}$, Basis: `{{ sw_params.fwl_basis }}`), log-derived $S_w$ was reconciled with capillary pressure ($P_c$) curves via the Leverett $J$-Function and Lab-to-Reservoir interfacial tension scaling:

$$P_{c,res} = P_{c,lab} \cdot \frac{(\sigma \cos\theta)_{res}}{(\sigma \cos\theta)_{lab}}, \quad h = TVD_{ss}(FWL) - TVD_{ss}, \quad J(S_w) = \frac{0.2166 \cdot P_{c,res}}{\sigma_{res} \cos\theta_{res}} \sqrt{\frac{K}{\phi}}$$

* **Reservoir Interfacial Tension & Wettability:** $(\sigma \cos\theta)_{res} = {{ "%.1f"|format(shf_params.ift_cos_theta) }}\text{ dynes/cm}$ ($\sigma_{res} = {{ shf_params.ift }}\text{ dynes/cm}$, $\theta_{res} = {{ shf_params.theta }}^\circ$).
* **Laboratory Fluid System & $P_c$ Scaling:** $(\sigma \cos\theta)_{lab} = {{ "%.1f"|format(shf_params.ift_lab_cos_theta) }}\text{ dynes/cm}$ ($\sigma_{lab} = {{ shf_params.ift_lab }}\text{ dynes/cm}$, $\theta_{lab} = {{ shf_params.theta_lab }}^\circ$; Multiplier $= {{ "%.4f"|format(shf_params.pc_scale_factor) }}\times$; Reference ${{ "%.1f"|format(shf_params.pc_lab_ref) }}\text{ psi Lab} \to {{ "%.3f"|format(shf_params.pc_res_ref) }}\text{ psi Reservoir}$; Lineage: `PC_LAB` $\to$ `PC`).
{% if poro_params.core_corrected %}
* **Core Overburden & Klinkenberg Stress Lineage:** $\sigma_{eff} = {{ "%.0f"|format(poro_params.net_confining_stress) }}\text{ psi}$ ({{ poro_params.core_lithology }}, $c_\phi = {{ "%.1e"|format(poro_params.compaction_coeff) }}\text{ psi}^{-1}$, $c_k = {{ "%.1e"|format(poro_params.perm_compaction_coeff) }}\text{ psi}^{-1}$), $P_m = {{ "%.1f"|format(poro_params.mean_pore_pressure) }}\text{ psi}$ ({{ poro_params.klinkenberg_method }}); baseline preserved in `CPORE_AMB` / `CPORE_ORI` and `CPERM_AIR` / `CPERM_ORI`, active curves updated in `CPORE` and `CPERM`.
{% endif %}
* **Fluid Density Gradient:** $\rho_w = {{ shf_params.gw }}\text{ g/cc}$, $\rho_{hc} = {{ shf_params.ghc }}\text{ g/cc}$ ($\Delta\rho = {{ "%.2f"|format(shf_params.gw - shf_params.ghc) }}\text{ g/cc}$).
* **Log $S_w$ vs. $SHF$ Reconciliation:** Mean RMSE $= {{ "%.3f"|format(shf_params.reconciliation_rmse) }}\text{ v/v}$, Mean Bias ($S_w - SHF$) $= {{ "%+.3f"|format(shf_params.reconciliation_bias) }}\text{ v/v}$.

